From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:10:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/syfs: fix wrong producers dir setup

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/sysfs.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/sysfs.c b/mm/damon/sysfs.c
index 8c28b7065cdc4..140e5f4682002 100644
--- a/mm/damon/sysfs.c
+++ b/mm/damon/sysfs.c
@@ -3320,7 +3320,7 @@ static int damon_sysfs_reports_add_dirs(struct damon_sysfs_reports *reports)
 	reports->producers = producers;
 
 	err = kobject_init_and_add(&producers->kobj,
-			&damon_sysfs_producers_ktype, &producers->kobj,
+			&damon_sysfs_producers_ktype, &reports->kobj,
 			"producers");
 	if (err)
 		goto put_producers_out;
